From 9212a164c105a92ffbac52c20d3146580aa34ed9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dsv41-builder <root@localhost>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 03:06:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] qwen: add process-isolated NVMe PLE offload

Keep the 47.68-GiB PLE table disk-backed, gather rows through the native pread backend, and move PLE ownership into a dedicated process so CUDA graph capture stays free of Python I/O and H2D scheduling.

Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>
